    "description": "Pre-selling in Empress at Capitol Commons\nWellness-Oriented Smart Luxury Residences by Ortigas Land\n\nDiscover a new standard of upscale living with Empress at Capitol Commons, a premier residential development that redefines comfort, wellness, and innovation in the heart of Pasig City.\n\nStrategically located within the exclusive Capitol Commons estate, The Empress is a 56-storey vertical community thoughtfully designed to promote holistic well-being and seamless urban living. As the first wellness residential tower in the Philippines, it blends modern architecture with biophilic design elements, ensuring a serene, health-centric environment for its residents.\n\nAvailable for Pre-Selling – A Smart Investment Opportunity\n\nSecure your unit at The Empress, a wellness-focused, smart residential tower by Ortigas Land in Capitol Commons, Pasig. With units available for pre-selling, this development offers strong investment potential and future value appreciation.\n\nTURNOVER: 4th Quarter of 2026\n\nIdeal for both end-users and investors looking for long-term growth in a prime location.\n\n2-Bedroom Units Overview:\n\nSize \u0026amp; Layout: Ranging from 104 to 116 sqm, each unit includes three bathrooms and a balcony, providing ample space for comfortable living. \n\nSmart Home Features: Units are equipped with smart home technology, including keyless entry, smart lighting, and temperature control, enhancing convenience and security.\n\nPremium Finishes: High-quality materials such as Hansgrohe and Kohler fixtures, porcelain tile flooring, and wood-laminated bedroom floors are standard, ensuring durability and elegance.\n\nAMENITIES:\n\nIndoor Amenities include:\n   •Residents’ Lounge\n   •Reading Room\n   •Function Hall\n   •Fitness Center\n   •Dance Studio\n   •Pamper Room\n   •Children’s Playroom\n\nOutdoor Amenities include:\n  ■Active Zone:\n     •25-meter Lap Pool\n     •Kiddie Pool\n     •Cabanas and Lounge Areas\n       gatherings.\n\n  ■Quiet Zone:\n     •Pocket Gardens\n     •Garden Deck\n     •Wellness Lawn\n\nKey Features:\n\nSmart Home-Ready Units\nIntegrated smart technology for lighting, climate control, and security, offering residents greater convenience and efficiency.\n\nWellness-Focused Design\nIncludes meditation rooms, a fitness center, garden lounges, and outdoor yoga decks—all created to support mental and physical well-being.\n\nPremium Living Spaces\nStudio to three-bedroom units with elegant finishes, efficient layouts, and generous natural light through floor-to-ceiling windows.\n\nPrime Location\nSituated within Capitol Commons, steps away from Estancia Mall, Unimart, world-class restaurants, offices, and green open spaces.\n\nProfessional Property Management \u0026amp; Security\nRound-the-clock security, concierge services, and a dedicated management team ensure peace of mind and first-rate service.\n\nContact me for more information: [hidden information] (Available on WhatsApp or Viber)\n\nNote: Photos shown are taken from the Empress at Capitol Commons Showroom by Ortigas Land and are for illustration purposes only. Actual unit finishes and features may vary.",
